      "writtenOn": "2022-05-16T21:04:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m following this shift operation, but it took me a couple looks. How about this?\n```\nint32_t run_time;\n...\n/* The response is 6 bytes; the runtime in seconds is the last 4 bytes. */\nrun_time \u003d *(int32_t *) data + 2;\n```",
